OL,3,GNEWSAPurchases are part of Leale's Yard
OL,4,Atransport plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe States of Guernsey has purchased
OL,7,Fproperty in the north of Guernsey as
OL,8,Fpart of a plan for transport links for
OL,9,Fthe Leale's Yard development.
OL,11,FThe sites, next to the site in St
OL,12,FSampson, were bought for a combined
OL,13,Fvalue of #2.12m on Tuesday and comprise
OL,14,Fof a plot of land, part of a garden,
OL,15,Ftwo houses and a workshop.
OL,17,FThe Policy & Resources Committee said
OL,18,Fprevious outline plans for transport
OL,19,Fand utilities infrastructure connecting
OL,20,FRoute Militaire through the Saltpans
OL,21,Fsite would be withdrawn and replaced by
OL,22,F"new more comprehensive plans".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
