OL,3,GNEWSAPurchases are part of Leale's Yard
OL,4,Atransport plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy Yvonne Burford, vice-president,
OL,7,Fsaid improving the transport network
OL,8,Fwas "crucial" in addressing the impact
OL,9,Fof the "much-needed" development.
